        "created_at": "2013-01-21T16:17:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was wondering when Unity might be available, again.&nbsp; The store is listed as Out of Stock.&nbsp; I'm assuming that the cards will be shipped with either the Vengence or Shattered Timelines decks, so around May or near end of year, but wanted to know.</p><p>Thanks for a lovely new obsession.&nbsp; My son and I just played AZ:EW, Visionary and Ra against the Enead in Megalopolis, and I have to say it was both the closest and funnest game I've yet had.&nbsp;</p>",
