        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-22T20:55:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unity is being reprinted along with Shattered Timelines, so they will both come in stock at the same time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While a small number of stores have purchased Unity (and Ambuscade) from us wholesale, very very few have done so, so most places you see it available online will most likely not be able to ship it until we ship it to them (after the reprints come back in).</p>",
