        "created_at": "2013-01-24T01:03:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks!&nbsp; I'll wait quite happily working through possibilities with the rather large number of possibilities in my current decks.&nbsp;</p><p>As another question, would it be possible to - admittedly quite after the fact - prepay for a Unity, etc, to be included in my Shattered Timelines package, once it's ready?</p><p>I should have al a carted back during the Kickstarter campaign, but I hadn't yet really gotten bitten by the radioactive Sentinel, yet.</p>",
